2026-07-27T18:21:59.3783140Z > # CRAN guard
2026-07-27T18:21:59.3783895Z > #
2026-07-27T18:21:59.3784538Z > # The duckdb test suite exercises DuckDB's bundled C++ engine, which is too heavy
