2026-07-27T18:21:59.3786482Z > # keep it off on CRAN but run it automatically on GitHub Actions (GITHUB_ACTIONS)
2026-07-27T18:21:59.3787386Z > # and on r-universe (MY_UNIVERSE). An explicit DUCKDB_R_RUN_TESTS opts in
