2026-07-27T18:21:59.4434885Z Loading required package: DBI
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4435143Z > 
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4435351Z > # CRAN guard
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4435555Z > #
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4435969Z > # The duckdb test suite exercises DuckDB's bundled C++ engine, which is too heavy
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4436568Z > # for CRAN's check farm, and checks were very fragile in the past. We therefore
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4437154Z > # keep it off on CRAN but run it automatically on GitHub Actions (GITHUB_ACTIONS)
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4437712Z > # and on r-universe (MY_UNIVERSE). An explicit DUCKDB_R_RUN_TESTS opts in
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4438280Z > # (true-ish) or out (false-ish) and always wins; otherwise we fall back to those.
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4438868Z > # This check is intentionally inlined here (rather than calling into the package)
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4439334Z > # so the guard is obvious and self-contained.
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4439785Z > run_tests <- tolower(trimws(Sys.getenv("DUCKDB_R_RUN_TESTS", "")))
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4440146Z > 
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4440424Z > if (run_tests %in% c("true", "1", "yes", "on")) {
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4440723Z +   run <- TRUE
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4441047Z + } else if (run_tests %in% c("false", "0", "no", "off")) {
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4441490Z +   run <- FALSE
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4441952Z + } else {
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4442328Z +   run <- tolower(trimws(Sys.getenv("GITHUB_ACTIONS", ""))) == "true" ||
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4442786Z +     nzchar(trimws(Sys.getenv("MY_UNIVERSE", "")))
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4443079Z + }
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4443258Z > 
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4443464Z > if (run) {
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4443723Z +   test_check(simulate_duckdb()$pkg)
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4443996Z + } else {
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4444197Z +   message(
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4444398Z +     "\n",
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4444621Z +     strrep("=", 78),
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4444847Z +     "\n",
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4445113Z +     "Skipping the duckdb test suite.\n",
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4445602Z +     "\n",
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4446016Z +     "The duckdb tests exercise DuckDB's bundled C++ engine and are deliberately\n",
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4446603Z +     "NOT run on CRAN. They run automatically on GitHub Actions (including\n",
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4447152Z +     "r-universe). This keeps check time and resource usage on CRAN within\n",
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4447731Z +     "acceptable limits and helps release duckdb in a predictable and controlled\n",
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4448152Z +     "manner.\n",
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4448367Z +     "\n",
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4448760Z +     "This is intentional, not an oversight. duckdb has an extensive test suite\n",
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4449380Z +     "that runs continuously in our own CI; see <https://github.com/duckdb/duckdb-r>.\n",
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4449790Z +     "\n",
2026-07-27T18:21:59.4450197Z +     "To run the test suite locally, set the environment variable before checking:\n",
